    "New York City, Albany, Syracuse, Rochester, Buffalo",
    "Founded more than 30 years ago, Fidelis Care provides quality, affordable health insurance coverage for more than 2.4 million children and adults. Fidelis Care is New York’s only statewide, government-programs health plan, dedicated to making quality healthcare accessible for everyone – no matter their income, background, age or zip code – so they can live life to the fullest.",
    "Learn more about Fidelis CareExternal Link",
    "Medicaid",
    "Child Health Plus",
    "Essential Plan",
    "Health and Recovery Plan",
    "Managed Long-Term Care",
    "In New York, Wellcare offers a range of Medicare products, including Medicare Advantage Prescription Drug plans (MAPD), Medicare Advantage only plans (MA only), Dual Eligible Special Needs Plans (DSNP), Private Fee-for-Service (PFFS) plans, and standalone Prescription Drug Plans (PDP). Our Medicare Advantage plans offer affordable coverage beyond Original Medicare, including a range of benefits such as dental, hearing, and vision services; transportation and fitness services; Spendables® Cards; and other wellness programs to help our members live better, healthier lives. Wellcare's standalone PDPs help cover the cost of prescription drugs including low monthly premiums and copays; access to a broad pharmacy network; and convenient delivery of medications. Not all benefits are available in all plans, view plans in your area.",
    "Learn more about WellcareExternal Link",
